      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/a88e4f/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-11-22T22:44:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><br>Any promos received at GenCon were not as a result of preordering.&nbsp; I was able to get some cards from another booth that were selling them from a vending machine but that had nothing to do with the items I preordered.&nbsp;</p><p>I can understand if Miniature Market was a KS backer.&nbsp; Aside from that, this is not good.&nbsp; Lesson learned in supporting this company this way.&nbsp; I'll just wait and get everything cheaper and first.</p>",
